WEBVTT

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:22.140
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.220
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.160
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:58.920
♪As such♪

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.800
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:04.960
♪As such♪

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:09.360
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.800
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.720
♪Everywhere♪

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:21.800
♪I regret not the time we spent together♪

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:27.800
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.480
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.400
♪A cherished love♪

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:46.040
♪Can never be parted♪

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:52.440
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:01:52.800 --> 00:02:01.840
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:07.840
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:12.010
=Episode 3=
(The Dream)

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:20.860
(Yi City)

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.200
Only a few dozen suppression charms.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.560
Will they be enough
to hold Xue Yang if he attacks?

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:27.200
He just had to use Empathy

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.380
instead of Inquiry.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:29.810
That lunatic.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.580
Empathy requires one to channel
themselves through a spirit

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.760
to see and feel their memories
as experienced.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.650
It is extremely dangerous
but also the most effective.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:37.360
Both of them are skilled cultivators.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.240
Besides, Senior Mo said

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.640
if anything goes wrong,

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:42.220
the Clarity Bell will
bring them back to consciousness.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.640
Do not worry.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.900
Who is worried?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.940
This is... the coffin home.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.000
Aren't you going to ask me who I am

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.450
and how did I get these injuries, Taoist?

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:22.690
You would tell me if you wanted to.
Why should I ask?

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:25.650
(Lan Zhan.)

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.200
Given the time line, this should be...

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:31.160
It should be around after Jin Guangyao
sentenced Xue Yang to death.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:32.580
Huh.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:33.490
Taoist!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.130
Please wait!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.260
That man would not tell us
where he came from.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.730
Aren't you worried he will be a trouble?

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.420
I am only helping

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.880
someone in need.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.540
When he recovers,

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.130
we will part ways again.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.620
But Xue Yang does not seem

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.020
like he will just "leave"
after he recovers.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.020
Qing,

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.940
since you have decided to follow me,
you should not steal anymore.

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:00.940
I am going on a night hunt tonight.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.260
Stay here

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.880
and look after him for me.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:09.020
Your foolish kindness
will come back to bite you someday!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:12.090
This girl seems to have been born
with white pupils.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.560
Yes. She is a good actress too.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.580
She even fooled me.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.520
Stupid threshold!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.730
I will have the taoist chop you
into pieces tomorrow!

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:32.720
Ow... It hurts...

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.340
She is clever and bold.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.520
Unfortunately,

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.850
her wits are no match

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.930
for a crafty and experienced bandit.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:56.400
You have already recovered,
yet you still won't leave.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.130
I will beat you up, you bad man.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.130
Are you going
on a night hunt again, Taoist?

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:02.560
Take me with you.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.560
I cannot.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.560
Every time you talk, I laugh.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.770
And if I laugh,
I cannot hold my sword properly.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.770
I promise I won't talk this time!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.920
Let me go with you!

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.980
(Libation)

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.360
Your swordsmanship is impressive indeed.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.420
Signs of livor mortis.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:13.260
Taoist has indeed been hunting corpses.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.890
Could it be that the delinquent

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.770
is actually helping him?

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.060
Little blind brat.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.450
What are you mumbling about over there?

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.210
I told you not
to call me "little blind brat"!

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.730
And what was that?

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:35.040
A candy. For you.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:36.250
It is by your foot.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.560
You are a strange guy.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:45.530
Eating candy every day.
Even though you are not a kid.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.410
Qing,

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:48.900
do you want to hear a story?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.580
There was once a little kid

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.600
who loved sweets.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:57.640
But he had neither parents nor money,

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.700
so he rarely got to eat candies.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.400
One day,

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.090
the little kid stood and stared longingly
in front of a malt candy stall.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.730
A man approached him
and asked him to deliver a letter.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.490
He promised him
a bag of candies in return.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.290
The kid was delighted.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.460
Unfortunately,

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.740
the recipient happened
to be that man's enemy.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.200
His enemy could not find that man,

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.560
so he beat the little kid up.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.370
The kid was beaten badly.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.490
But that was all right to him,
as long as he got his candy.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.580
He struggled to his feet

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:29.800
and searched for that man.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.360
Eventually, he found him.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.580
And what happened after that?

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.640
And...

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.320
He asked for his candy.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:39.220
But instead, the man struck him
with a whip, and he fell to the ground.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.220
What sort of story is that? It sucks!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.440
It makes me so mad!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.970
Why were you like that
when you were a little kid?

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.260
If it were me, I would...

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:46.850
I would spit

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.850
in his food and water,

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:49.940
and beat him up!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.040
All right. All right.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:52.610
The story is finished.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.610
It is late. Let us get some rest.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:00.170
A childhood obsession
can affect one's entire life.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.330
You are faring well now.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.330
You should try not to dwell on your past.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.330
I am not.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.640
But my candies are running out,

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.420
so I cannot help but remember the days

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:12.810
when I could not have any...

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:31.380
(Yi City)

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.047
(Yi City)

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:34.820
(Two years later)

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:42.660
I have to get back before it rains.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.960
Xue Yang!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:02.960
Oh, my.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.460
Taoist Song. How rare of you to visit.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.540
Here for dinner?

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.960
Why are you so mad?

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:12.730
Xue Yang!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.010
You took advantage of his blindness

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:15.650
and deceived him!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.120
His blindness?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.380
Have you forgotten

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:24.140
who he gave his eyes to, Taoist Song?

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.370
And who was the one
who took his anger out on him

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:31.140
and told him
he never wanted to see him ever again?

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.180
Why are you here?

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.480
Frost sensed something.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.240
So I followed its directions here.

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:07.220
It has been a long time
since I encountered

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.210
a corpse in this area,
not to mention a lone one.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.060
Did it come from somewhere else?

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.330
Song Zichen looked for Xiao Xingchen
for two years?

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.130
Mm.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.520
He never expected their reunion

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.920
to be a parting of life and death.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.050
Where do you think you are going?

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.210
Don't bother screaming,
little blind brat.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:29.180
Or should I say... Little liar.

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:33.080
Your precious taoist has already left.
He cannot save you now.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.290
Xue Yang,

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.170
you monster!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.490
He was so kind to you!

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:38.420
He saved you

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.840
and gave you candies every day!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.920
But you betrayed him!
You are absolutely mad!

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.080
You ingrate!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:44.770
Speaking of candies...

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:47.300
About that story
of the kid and the candy...

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:49.360
I actually have not finished...

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.050
Xue Yang!

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.300
I...

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.620
should not have promised
to help you buy vegetables today.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.820
You have hidden yourself by my side
for these past years.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.730
What exactly are your intentions?

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:08.000
Take it easy, Taoist Xiao.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.260
They call me a monster and a mad man.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.580
Why not let me finish my story then?

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.200
Do not want to hear it?

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.560
Well, I want you to!

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:16.690
That day,

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.980
the kid chased after the man's carriage.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.840
He wanted his candy so badly.

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.340
But that man grew annoyed with him

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.000
and struck him with a whip.
The kid fell to the ground.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.250
And...

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.320
The wheels of the carriage

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.240
ran over the boy's finger...

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.020
That man

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.660
was Chang Ping's father!

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.820
Chang Ci'an broke one of your fingers.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.570
Yet you killed his entire clan!

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.160
Only about fifty people.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.740
How could their lives make up
for my finger?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.040
What about everyone else then?

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.120
What about the Baixue Temple?

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.530
What about Song Zichen?

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.020
That is a question
you should ask yourself,

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:54.280
Xiao Xingchen.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:57.520
Why did you have to stand up
for those dregs?

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.060
You helped them.

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.210
And what happened then?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.210
Chang Ping retracted his claim,

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.720
and your name was sullied instead!

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:07.800
You made a mistake from the start!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.780
Xue Yang...

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.220
You are indeed...

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:18.740
Disgusting.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.010
Disgusting?

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:30.060
What gives you the right to call me that?

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.840
Xiao Xingchen,

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:35.120
do you know what exactly
have we been hunting

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.020
for the past two years?

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:41.240
Your Frost

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:42.860
is able to pick up the scent of corpses.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.730
But it cannot tell
a live being from a dead.

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.880
So all I had to do
was remove their tongues,

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.970
so that they could do nothing but wail.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.170
And spread corpse poison on them...

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.050
Silence!

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.320
You are lying!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.460
You are just trying to trick me!

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:54.100
Yes.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.340
I have always been lying to you.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:02.050
And do you know
who was it you just killed?

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:04.740
He said I took advantage
of your blindness

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.520
(Snow)
and deceived you.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.290
But he forgot

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:13.320
who was the person you gave your eyes to.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.060
Saving the world?

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.400
What a joke!

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.690
You cannot even save yourself!

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:28.260
You think you can change the world
just by doing good deeds?

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.330
You fool!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.840
You self-righteously proclaim that you
punish evil in the name of justice!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.360
But all you have done
is bringing trouble to yourself!

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.120
And you have caused the people
around you to suffer because of you!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.580
In the end, you failed miserably.
You are the only one to blame.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.320
You asked for all of this!

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:13.380
(Yi City)

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.500
It is better that he is dead.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.620
Only the dead listen.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.090
He is awake!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.260
Hanguang-jun, Senior Mo,

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.440
Xue Yang is...

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.860
He came as expected.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:02.720
- Hanguang-jun...
- Hanguang-jun...

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.760
Over there! There're many corpses!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.810
What should we do now?

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:11.810
That is easy.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.420
(Xue Yang)

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.620
(must die!)

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.250
Enchanting eyes.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.940
Smiling lips of red.

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:44.050
I ask not of good or evil.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:47.200
Heed my call!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.160
Kill them.

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:16.040
Sizhui.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.480
Senior Mo.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:18.730
You are the most mature
out of all of them.

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.210
Stay here and make sure everyone is safe.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.280
Do not be afraid.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:23.640
I am not afraid.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.220
Senior.

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.810
You and Hanguang-jun are really alike.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:29.440
Alike?

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:30.940
How so?

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:34.920
Whenever one of you are around,

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.040
I feel like I do not have
to worry about anything.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.610
Some things are just too loyal.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.050
What a pain.

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:18.580
Wen Ning...

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.920
is not a "thing".

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:22.560
Give it back!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.010
Give it back to me!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:37.890
Which?

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:39.250
Frost?

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:41.410
Or Xiao Xingchen's soul?

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.500
You don't deserve either one.

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:51.370
Wen Ning,

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.340
head to the coffin home
and protect Jin Ling and the others.

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:54.120
Understood.

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.980
He has some skills, all right.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.120
Qing?

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:05.370
This fog causes hallucinations.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.450
It is difficult to locate him.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.610
I'm afraid it will be difficult for Qing
to follow him.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.840
Why bother, Xue Yang?

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:16.320
So what if you got
the spirit-trapping pouch back?

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:19.460
You cannot bring back someone
who no longer has the will to live.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:21.180
He doesn't get

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.540
to decide that!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:24.420
Over there.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:31.040
Little blind brat?

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:32.850
Aren't you afraid
that I will tear your soul into pieces?

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.960
Come on, Xue Yang,

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:36.250
why are you so determined
to bring Xiao Xingchen back to life?

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.960
To go back to the good old days?

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.360
Do not be naive.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.580
Xiao Xingchen despises you.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.860
Who wants to go back to the past?

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.420
I just want to turn him
into a fierce corpse! An evil spirit!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.380
He wanted to be someone virtuous,
did he not?

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.840
Then I will make it so
that he never stops killing.

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.100
So that he can never be at peace!

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.760
Do you really hate him that much?

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.000
Then why did you kill Chang Ping?

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.400
They took my finger...

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:05.050
So I will wipe out the entire Chang clan,
every single one of them!

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.800
Oh, I see. For revenge, huh?

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:11.410
But why did you use Frost
instead of your Calamity?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:14.960
Xue Yang,

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:16.960
you did get revenge.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.240
But whose sake was it for?

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:21.020
If you really wanted to avenge him,

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:23.050
the one you should have executed

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.560
is yourself!

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.560
Blind brat...

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:00.490
Scram!

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:03.370
A teleportation talisman?

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:14.770
It takes a lot of spiritual energy
to cast this talisman.

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:17.170
They wanted to take Xue Yang away
even when he is already dead.

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:19.980
The Stygian Tiger Amulet
must be with Xue Yang.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:51.140
(Yi City)

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:00.410
Xiao Xingchen was your closest friend.

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:02.010
You should be the one

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:03.980
to take care of Frost.

00:24:23.120 --> 00:24:26.100
Taoist Xiao and Qing.

00:24:29.660 --> 00:24:30.407
(Yi City)

00:24:30.450 --> 00:24:31.480
Taoist Song,

00:24:32.050 --> 00:24:33.480
the matter at Yi City has been solved.

00:24:33.780 --> 00:24:35.320
What will you do

00:24:36.010 --> 00:24:37.240
with Taoist Xiao's remains?

00:24:41.400 --> 00:24:43.050
"The body shall be cremated."

00:24:44.020 --> 00:24:45.540
"So that the soul may rest in peace."

00:25:20.490 --> 00:25:21.420
What about after this?

00:25:21.900 --> 00:25:23.360
What do you intend to do from now on?

00:25:28.603 --> 00:25:29.690
(I will roam this world)

00:25:30.170 --> 00:25:31.500
(with Frost)

00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:33.660
(and exorcise evil)

00:25:33.660 --> 00:25:35.250
(with Xingchen.)

00:25:37.180 --> 00:25:38.410
(When he wakes,)

00:25:38.600 --> 00:25:39.530
(I will tell him...)

00:25:40.500 --> 00:25:41.530
("I am sorry.")

00:25:42.610 --> 00:25:44.170
("It was not your fault.")

00:25:59.300 --> 00:26:00.460
♪The swallows♪

00:26:00.540 --> 00:26:01.580
♪Fly away♪

00:26:01.900 --> 00:26:03.700
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:26:04.140 --> 00:26:05.340
♪I strum the strings♪

00:26:05.420 --> 00:26:06.540
♪And play the song♪

00:26:06.700 --> 00:26:08.340
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:26:08.940 --> 00:26:10.180
♪Who is sighing♪

00:26:10.220 --> 00:26:11.220
♪In sorrow?♪

00:26:11.460 --> 00:26:13.540
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:26:13.820 --> 00:26:14.980
♪When all is said and done♪

00:26:15.060 --> 00:26:17.620
♪I cherish every moment we are together♪

00:26:18.620 --> 00:26:19.780
♪A toast♪

00:26:19.860 --> 00:26:21.060
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:26:21.180 --> 00:26:22.820
♪We sit in a boat, gazing up to the moon♪

00:26:23.420 --> 00:26:24.580
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:26:24.620 --> 00:26:25.700
♪On the shore♪

00:26:25.740 --> 00:26:27.780
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:26:28.100 --> 00:26:29.260
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:26:29.420 --> 00:26:30.580
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:26:30.700 --> 00:26:32.420
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:26:32.980 --> 00:26:34.180
♪No amount of gold♪

00:26:34.260 --> 00:26:37.660
♪Would bring me to give up
these precious memories♪

00:26:39.420 --> 00:26:41.300
♪I wish never to forget those years♪

00:26:41.300 --> 00:26:44.020
♪I spent searching for you♪

00:26:44.460 --> 00:26:45.540
♪Through the mountains and rivers♪

00:26:45.580 --> 00:26:48.740
♪I've searched for you♪

00:26:49.260 --> 00:26:50.860
♪There you were♪

00:26:51.580 --> 00:26:53.300
♪By the dim light♪

00:26:53.540 --> 00:26:57.300
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:26:58.780 --> 00:27:00.620
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:27:00.740 --> 00:27:03.060
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:27:03.700 --> 00:27:05.380
♪One dressed in white, one clad in black♪

00:27:05.500 --> 00:27:08.060
♪Playing a song together♪

00:27:08.300 --> 00:27:10.260
♪As we watch the sunset♪

00:27:10.700 --> 00:27:12.460
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:27:12.660 --> 00:27:15.820
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
